    "updated_at": "2026-10-02T10:37:15Z",
    "body": "Sure. (Even in a browser, I would expect `new XMLSerializer().serializeToString(new DOMParser().parseFromString(…, \"text/html\"))` to map conforming documents to conforming documents, but I guess a browser used as a parser still counts as a parser.)",
