    "created_at": "2026-10-02T15:17:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-02T15:17:23Z",
    "body": "@josepharhar \n\nThe cloning could maybe trim `id` attributes, but not sure it completely solves the problem of cloning causing an invalid document.\n\nThe serializer could maybe avoid serializing children of `selectedcontent`.\n\nThe content model of `selectedcontent` shouldn't be \"Nothing\" since it's violated after cloning.",
