    "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:05:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-03T18:05:13Z",
    "body": "Maybe we could update the content model of the selectedcontent element to allow the same things as option elements. It says nothing right now because authors shouldn't actually be putting HTML in there, but if that isn't really meant for authors and more for this cloning conformance case then we could change it.\n\nIf you're going to use the selectedcontent element, then its probably not a good idea to put id attributes on the things being cloned.",
